+# Phase 2B.2 ? actual reference production/shadow comparison
+
+Both existing references completed the full headless pipeline in `subject_based` mode with the final implementation. Images were read-only; SHA-256 hashes before/after matched. No raw images, prompts, attribution values or complete detector payloads are copied into this report. Detailed outputs remain ignored under `analyzed/phase2b2_validation/{instagram,midjourney}/`.
+
+## Policy boundary
+
+Default shadow scoring uses structural-restatement rules only. The audit does not establish any current detector as an exact restatement with no added localization, relationship or interpretation. Existing child credit is therefore retained provisionally; its calibrated marginal value is null. This is explicit uncertainty, not a claim that the child has full independent evidential weight. No coefficients or family budgets were invented.
+
+A separate explicit `ExperimentalCredits` call assigns zero base units to the audit-A composite set: cross, boundary, focus, alignment, regional FFT, spatial patch and process asymmetry, where those rows are present. This is an unvalidated conditional base-credit experiment. Existing adjusted boosts, penalties, camera attenuation and guards remain fixed. It does not produce a confidence tier or hypothesis and must not be evaluated against current production thresholds.
+
+## Main comparison
+
+| Metric | Instagram production | Instagram shadow | Midjourney production | Midjourney shadow |
+| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
+| Suspicious aggregate | 20.47705 | 20.47705 | 6.0375 | 6.0375 |
+| Benign aggregate | 2.25 | 2.25 | 1.5 | 1.5 |
+| Observed weighted section indicators | 13 | 13 | 6 | 6 |
+| Distinct feature-extraction ancestries | not previously tracked | 12 | not previously tracked | 6 |
+| Shared non-geometry ancestor groups | audit-derived | 4 | audit-derived | 2 |
+| Hypothesis | localized_editing | no shadow decision | synthetic_origin; unverified declaration | no shadow decision |
+| Confidence | High | not recalculated | Medium | not recalculated |
+| Failed stages | 0 | same run | 0 | same run |
+| Experimental audit-A S | authoritative baseline unchanged | 13.46455 | authoritative baseline unchanged | 3.9125 |
+
+Indicator counts mean status-weighted section records, including benign rows. Neutral parent maps can be measured and contribute ancestry without a base weight. Ancestry counts exclude selected mask geometry, retain optional measured parents used by asymmetry, and do not count statistically independent observations. No shadow tier, classification or independence count is assigned.
+
+## Instagram
+
+Production pattern: `possible_foreground_background_processing_mismatch`; confidence High; primary hypothesis `localized_editing`. Exact equality checks passed against the Phase 2A scorecard, calculation ledger, hypothesis assessments and decision dictionary. Enabling/disabling the sidecar on the same state also preserves the entire existing trace and rendered text/HTML.
